<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:scr="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions;assembly=Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions"
                 xmlns:pyl="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Pylon;assembly=Bonsai.Pylon"
                 xmlns:zap="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Zapit;assembly=OpenRigs.Zapit"
                 xmlns:core="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Core;assembly=OpenRigs.Core"
                 xmlns:dev="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Devices;assembly=OpenRigs.Devices"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>The Zapit camera, Camera-Zapit, at ConnectForTaskZapitDaq's top level, opened only once ZapitRig (rig.yml's zapit block, on a rig whose zapit block names its NI device) has a value (the SelectMany Camera-Zapit): OpenRigs.Zapit's ZapitPylonCapture (Bonsai.Pylon's PylonCapture) with zapit.camera's serialNumber and its session settings file (sessionPfsPath, relative to rig.yml's folder: ResolveRigFile stops the workflow at start on a full path or no file), taking each Camera-Zapit.Settings from ZapitSetup: a grid run's exposure and gain (auto off) set while it grabs, the session's put back after the run, and the viewed frame's crop (Zapit-Main.Crop, before or after Go). Each frame (View, the stretched picture cut to the crop Camera-Zapit.Settings last set, which StreamDevices streams; Image, the same picture whole, which LogVideoFfmpeg records; Still, the whole frame, at Mono8's scale during a grid run, which ZapitSetup saves; and ChunkData of the grab's ID and camera timestamp, as FfmpegVideoWriter reads it) is stamped with the latest Harp time (WithLatestTimestamp) and published on Camera-Zapit.Data, here at the top level so the including workflow sees it: StreamDevices streams it as the camera Zapit and ZapitSetup saves stills from it. A SelectMany is a subject scope of its own, so a Camera-Zapit.Data published inside one reached no StreamDevices. In an optogenetics experiment, once the experiment folder exists (PathPrefix), the frames are recorded as Camera-Zapit (LogVideoFfmpeg) at the frequency of the board trigger whose wiring line names Camera-Zapit in targets (CameraTriggerLine: the workflow stops at start without exactly one). Needs ZapitRig, RigFile, Camera-Zapit.Settings, ConfigRoot, Timestamp, PathPrefix, Optogenetics, BehaviorBoard-Main and BehaviorBoard-Main.Data from the workflow.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>ZapitRig</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
        <Name>Camera-Zapit</Name>
        <Description>Once rig.yml's zapit block names its NI device (ZapitRig): the camera's frames, stamped with Harp time, and their recording in an optogenetics experiment.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ZapitRig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Camera.SerialNumber</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RigFile</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ZapitRig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Camera.SessionPfsPath</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="core:ResolveRigFile">
                <core:Directory />
                <core:Setting>zapit.camera.sessionPfsPath</core:Setting>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="SerialNumber" Selector="Item1" />
                <Property Name="ParameterFile" Selector="Item2" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="zap:ZapitPylonCapture">
                <pyl:SerialNumber>UNMAPPED</pyl:SerialNumber>
                <pyl:ParameterFile>UNMAPPED</pyl:ParameterFile>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Expression>new(View as View, Image as Image, Still as Still, CropReports as CropReports, new(FrameID as FrameID, Timestamp as Timestamp) as ChunkData)</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
              <Name>Timestamp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>BehaviorBoard-Main</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dev:CameraTriggerLine">
                <dev:Camera>Camera-Zapit</dev:Camera>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>PathPrefix</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Optogenetics</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>RecordZapit?</Name>
              <Description>An optogenetics experiment, its folder made.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>Item2</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:SubscribeWhen" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="FrameRate" Selector="Item2" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ConfigRoot</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="ConfigRoot" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogVideoFfmpeg.bonsai">
              <Name>Camera-Zapit</Name>
              <FrameRate>50</FrameRate>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Camera-Zapit.Settings</Name>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="25" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="24" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="17" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="17" To="18" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="19" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="18" To="19" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="14" To="20" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="21" To="22" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="19" To="23" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="20" To="23" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="22" To="23" Label="Source3" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject">
        <Name>Camera-Zapit.Data</Name>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
